### VK Jewellers — API Security Checks (VS Code REST Client / Thunder Client)

@baseUrl = http://localhost:5000/api
@adminEmail = admin@yourdomain.com
@adminPassword = StrongAdminPassword@123

### Health (public)
GET {{baseUrl}}/health

### Admin dashboard — must be 401 without token
GET {{baseUrl}}/admin/dashboard

### Admin dashboard — must be 401 with bad token
GET {{baseUrl}}/admin/dashboard
Authorization: Bearer invalid.token.value

### Login brute-force guard (repeat to test 429)
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "wrong@test.com",
  "password": "wrongpassword"
}

### Register role escalation — must create customer, not admin
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Escalation Test",
  "email": "escalation-{{$timestamp}}@test.local",
  "password": "TestPass@123",
  "role": "admin"
}

### Admin login (save token from response)
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "{{adminEmail}}",
  "password": "{{adminPassword}}"
}

### Admin dashboard — must be 200 with valid token
# @token = paste-token-here
GET {{baseUrl}}/admin/dashboard
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Vendor dashboard — must be 401 without token
GET {{baseUrl}}/vendor/dashboard
